  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo>'</mo><mo>'</mo></mrow></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow><mrow><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>log</mi><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>C</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>f</mi><mo>'</mo></msup><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mn>0</mn></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><msubsup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>0</mn><mn>1</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>k</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>K</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp; &nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo></math></p><p>From Eqs. <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>ii</mi><mo>)</mo></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>iii</mi><mo>)</mo></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></mf